            <ArticleTitle>A rapid flow strategy for the oxidative cyanation of secondary and tertiary amines via C-H activation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>16311</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1038/s41598-017-16410-5</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An efficient continuous flow protocol has been developed for bond C-H activation which promotes the α-cyanation of secondary and tertiary amines using magnetic nano-ferrites.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
